{"unit_id":"Chinesezjc__dsh-interconnect#card-zh","repo":"Chinesezjc/dsh-interconnect","commit":"a42434ab6f41a2d3682ed57088b38bdd4302e247","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-interconnect**（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH 客户端）：让不同 DSH 实例的会话互通。它注册 interconnect 服务、六个模型工具和配套 skill，通过持久 WebSocket 连接对端，支持列出在线会话、探测状态、转发消息、回复最近发送方及同步 agent/session 生命周期事件。消息可用 followup、steer 或 inject 方式投递，也可请求唤醒休眠会话。适合跨设备协作；需配置 peer origin，并在双方设置相同的 DSH_INTERCONNECT_TOKEN。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/interconnect/index.ts:359-367","src/tool-interconnect/index.ts:95-100","src/skill-interconnect/index.ts:61-67"]}
